Modified for the italki UI Kit: the consistency and design-token sections of
design-critique, design-system and design-handoff were rewritten to cite this
kit's own contracts — the semantic token handoff table, the closed typography
set, one red CTA per task step, and the runtime-asserted component props —
rather than generic design-system practice. accessibility-review and ux-copy
were pointed at this kit's theme mapping and content style. research-synthesis
and user-research are unmodified. Kit-relative paths are written {KIT} and
resolved when enforcement/install.mjs places these in a project.

